* Stand-in for the ADAU board on the Amp sheet's 8-pin interconnect (J11):
*  1 GND, 2 +3V3, 3 AUDIO0 (right), 4 AUDIO1 (left), 5 AMP_SD (low = run), 6 AMP_FAULT (monitor only), 7 AMP_MUTE (low = unmuted), 8 GND
* Set the test tone from the symbol's Sim.Params:  amp=<peak volts>  f=<Hz>
.subckt J_ADAU_STUB P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 P6 P7 P8 params: amp=0.35 f=1k
VA P3 P1 SIN(0 {amp} {f})
VB P4 P1 SIN(0 {amp} {f})
V33 P2 P1 DC 3.3
RSD P5 P1 1k
RMU P7 P1 1k
RFL P6 P1 1G
RG8 P8 P1 1m
.ends J_ADAU_STUB
